            "fort → FOR (final 't' silent; here an adverb 'strongly' — 'je pense fort à toi' = I'm thinking of you a great deal)",
            "moment → moh-MAH(n) ('-ment' nasal; 'en ce moment difficile' = in this difficult time)",
